WEBVTT

40:31.122 --> 40:33.040
Because...

40:33.165 --> 40:35.543
you're a bastard from the North.

40:37.378 --> 40:39.880
I never met my mother.

40:40.006 --> 40:42.675
My father wouldn't even
tell me her name.

40:42.800 --> 40:44.969
I don't know if she's living or dead.

40:47.388 --> 40:51.434
I don't know if she's a noblewoman
or a fisherman's wife...

40:53.352 --> 40:55.354
or a whore.

40:57.481 --> 40:59.817
So I sat there

40:59.942 --> 41:03.154
in the brothel as Ros
took off her clothes.
